<a class="back-link" href="/locals">← Volver a locales</a>
<header class="page-header">
  <div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Propiedades</span>
    <h1>Agregar un local</h1>
    <p>Usá un nombre fácil de reconocer, como “Local de la esquina”.</p>
  </div>
</header>
<form action="/locals" method="post" class="form-card narrow">
  <div class="field">
    <label for="name">Nombre del local</label
    ><input
      id="name"
      name="name"
      value=""
      required
      placeholder="Ej.: Local 1"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="field">
    <label for="address">Dirección</label
    ><input
      id="address"
      name="address"
      value=""
      required
      placeholder="Calle y número"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="form-actions">
    <a href="/locals" class="btn btn--secondary">Cancelar</a
    ><button class="btn btn--primary" type="submit">Guardar local</button>
  </div>
</form>
